I don't have any idea now how the API should look like. But for now, I guess you can emulate the behavior by removing the bulitin `vite:build-import-analysis` plugin for build.
```js
const plugin = {
  name: 'remover',
  configResolved(config) {
    const pI = config.plugins.findIndex(
      (p) => p.name === 'vite:build-import-analysis'
    );
    config.plugins.splice(pI, 1);
  },
  renderChunk(code) {
    return 'const __VITE_IS_MODERN__=true;' + code;
  },
},
```
I don't recommend using this in prod and may break in the future. That said, I think it should be enough to work on a POC and find out how the API should be.

